                          "builtin-detail | Specifies a built-in (alias) for a match condition that matches multiple flags, or specifies particular logic as to the flag matches to be implemented. This leaf is only valid when the detail-match-mode leaf is BUILTIN.": ["TCP_INITIAL", "TCP_ESTABLISHED", "FRAGMENT"]
